---
const day = 29;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>Pizza Lab｜Day{day}</title></head><body>
<main><header><span class="brand">PIZZA LAB</span><span>Day {day} · Pizza 購物車</span></header><div class="intro"><h1>今天，想吃哪個 Pizza？</h1><p>選個口味，調整數量，再看看你的購物車。</p></div>
<div class="menu"><span>瑪格麗特 <strong>NT$ 280</strong></span><span>蘑菇起司 <strong>NT$ 320</strong></span><span>辣味臘腸 <strong>NT$ 360</strong></span></div>
<div class="workspace"><section><h2>自己選一份</h2><form id="cart-form" novalidate><label>Pizza<select id="pizza-id"><option value="margherita">瑪格麗特</option><option value="mushroom">蘑菇起司</option><option value="pepperoni">辣味臘腸</option></select></label><label>數量<input id="quantity" type="number" min="1" max="10" step="1" value="2" /></label><label>備註<input id="note" value="不要辣" /></label><button>檢查這份選擇</button></form><p id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><pre id="form-result"></pre></section><section><h2>查一下菜單</h2><form id="menu-form"><label>餐點編號<input id="lookup-id" value="margherita" /></label><button>查詢餐點</button></form><p id="menu-result" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="hint">可查詢 margherita、mushroom、pepperoni。</p></section></div>
<section class="day-focus" aria-labelledby="day-focus"><h2 id="day-focus">Day 29｜本日重點</h2>
<p>沿用前一天的型別與驗證規則，新增菜單查詢及購物車摘要。</p>
<ul><li>上方可查詢餐點，觀察找到與找不到的結果。</li><li>摘要函式由測試確認總額、數量與備註，這個版本先不接進表單。</li><li>用 ESLint 檢查 any 與 !，修正後一起跑原有及新增測試。</li></ul>
<a href="/development">查看擴充需求、ESLint 與修正 Prompt →</a></section>
<footer>教學範例 · 使用固定資料 · 不會送出訂單</footer></main>
<script>import '../client';</script>
</body></html>
<style is:global>
:root{font-family:Arial,"Noto Sans TC",sans-serif;color:#172d43;background:#eaf0f4;--navy:#172d43;--red:#bc292f;--yellow:#f2cb58;--paper:#fffdf6}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:30px 24px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:3px solid var(--navy);padding-bottom:18px}.brand{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px}.intro{padding:32px 0 22px}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px);margin:0 0 12px}h2{font-size:22px;margin-top:0}p{line-height:1.7}.menu{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:var(--yellow);padding:16px 20px;border:2px solid var(--navy)}.menu span{display:flex;gap:14px}.workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:24px}section{background:var(--paper);padding:24px;border:1px solid #b6c4ce;border-top:5px solid var(--red)}form{display:grid;gap:14px}label{display:grid;gap:7px;font-weight:bold}input,select,textarea,button{font:inherit;padding:11px;border:1px solid #8f9faa;border-radius:4px;width:100%}textarea{min-height:75px}button{background:var(--red);color:white;border:0;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{background:#87939c;cursor:default}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #286ca5;outline-offset:3px}pre{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.day-focus{margin-top:24px}li{line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:10px}a{color:#286ca5;font-weight:bold}.hint,footer{font-size:14px;color:#475d6d}footer{padding:25px 0}.receipt{border-top-color:var(--navy);background:white}[role=status]{min-height:1.6em}@media(max-width:700px){.workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}main{padding:20px 16px}header{gap:16px;font-size:13px}}
</style>
